After a long research, our Shaolin Masters have found an ancient artifact that gives incredible power! Thanks to its magical properties, you can go back in time, but leave with you all the gained experience and the items of equipment founded before.

However, be careful! The power of the artifact feeds not only you, but also your enemies. They become stronger and most importantly - more dangerous! The head of the school named this artifact [b] NEW GAME + [/b]. If you want to get it, you must show your strength by completing the game on any difficulty.

Features of the mode:
- you keep all the progress of the character obtained in the main mode;
- enemies are getting stronger;
- when replaying, you can open improved versions of weapons in the "golden version":

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/32342132/ef93a69d33cdbe7a79dd1310d5490518dbfa6c1d.png[/img]

Also, as promised, we've added [b]wijayap096[/b] in credits us the tournament winner! 
Congratulations! :)

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/32342132/34473e5934710a1fb006dba12bea00607957f3f1.png[/img]

The good news does not end there. From today on [b]9 Monkeys of Shaolin[/b] there is a 30% off! A great opportunity to finally complete the game with a friend, if you haven't already;)

Well, on top of the cake, there are some small fixes as well:
- fixed bug with dialog in online co-op mode;
- fixed colliders in several levels;
- fixed the jump animation after restarting the level in special boots;
- fixed colliders after restarting the level Naha Street;
- fixed sound of whetstone in the camp.

Be strong, be calm and don't forget to perfect your kung-fu!
Happy holidays, with love, Sobaka Studio!

[h3]Now everyone can find out how good your kung fu is! 9 Monkeys of Shaolin has been updated with a Leaderboard table, trading cards and profile badges. [/h3]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/32342132/6e44de521fd2635e7d7c2359a25fa29a3d52fdf7.png[/img]

Compete with friends and against friends, conquer the top of the ratings and make history as a true Shaolin master! The game is available at 15% discount till December 1st, 2020. 

[h3]Details on the update:[/h3]

[b]Features:[/b]
[list]
[*]Leaderboards for each level with the ability to view the Global results and the results of your Steam friends.
[*]Trading Cards.
[*]Badges.[/list]

[b]Fixes:[/b]
[list]
[*]balanced the Seal of Attraction;
[*]fixed animation of strikes when they are made from the air;
[*]fixed the ability to press restart after the end of the level in some levels, for example, Sawmill;
[*]removed the ability to change difficulty in the Pause Menu;
[*]fixed a bug with a camera in the Swamp;
[*]fixed a lever/level typo in the Silver Mine;
[*]fixed display of dialogs in Naha Streets when playing in Online co-op mode;
[*]fixed overlapping descriptions in the armory for different screen sizes;
[*]fixed the suicide enemy running out at Poyang Lake;
[*]added auto kill of enemies in the Swamp when they fall down;
[*]fixed a bug with display of some secrets;
[*]fixed the constant display of a new weapon icon on the ship in the camp;
[*]fixed the output of tasks in the location of the Silver Mine.[/list]

Enjoy the game!
Sobaka Studio <3

Hi everyone!

Here's our weekly patch notes news! Yesterday we released the 1.03 version of 9 Monkeys of Shaolin, where we fixed the following issues:

— fixed co-op connectivity issues to severely reduce lagging;
— fixed the Lake Poyang mission not being required to unlock the final mission in Chapter 2;
— boss missions now have more distinctive icons on the map;
— fixed second player placement at the start of the encounter in coop when both players are too far away from each other;
— fixed lightning in the Eight Diagrams mission in co-op;
— fixed a bug in the final mission in Chapter 2 where the objective message would appear after you've been killed by the boss.

Once again thank you for your feedback! And now, we're back to work!
